/*
 * snippet::diagnostic — one report, whole.
 *
 * A `Diagnostic` is what one failure prints: its `Header`, the excerpts it
 * points at, the notes it adds, the edits it proposes and the `TraceFrame`s it
 * was reached through. There is no sub report — a diagnostic tree is flattened
 * into a flat list of these before anything is written, so nothing recurses at
 * print time.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::errors::snippet::diagnostic
 * @File: ymirc/errors/snippet/diagnostic.yr
 * @Author(s):
